    "Claude Code at the live catalog rather than your local var/ copy.",
    "Discover, resolve and feedback need no key, so there is no headers block.",
    "Add \"headers\": {\"Authorization\": \"Bearer ${LATTICE_API_KEY}\"} only on a",
    "machine that publishes, with the variable set (an app key from",
    "lattice_register_app or the operator key from /etc/schemalattice/env)."
